<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to tender 20 bln ATS 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Austria to tender 20 bln ATS 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Kontrollbank, the government's financing agent, announced the following issue on Friday.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 20 billion schillings</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: 20 May 1997</p>
<p>MATURITY: 23 May 2002</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
